 621  83CE 21 66 97             LD      HL,Msg2DPass
 622  83D1 CD A5 91             CALL    DebugPrint
 623  83D4 CD 7E 8F             CALL    SpectrumShow2DPass
 624  83D7 CD 7B 91             CALL    WaitSpace
