1006  86C0              ; VGA text-mode test: 80x25, character plane 0, attribute plane 1.
1007  86C0              ; Uses the adapter's bank-6 text aperture (C000h-C7CFh).
1008  86C0              ; Scrolls rows 1..24 to rows 0..23, clears row 24, then verifies
1009  86C0              ; character and attribute readback through the VGA plane read map.
